00:00:46.694 --> 00:00:49.096
JERUSALEM.

00:00:47.328 --> 00:00:50.097
25 YEARS AFTER AMERICA FIRST

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:53.334
PLEDGED TO DO SO.

00:00:50.231 --> 00:00:54.135
&gt;&gt; WHAT A GLORIOUS DAY.

00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:58.272
REMEMBER THIS MOMENT

