00:01:31.205 --> 00:01:34.074
53 THREE MILES SOUTH THE

00:01:32.706 --> 00:01:35.443
MOVE INFLAMED THE PROTESTS

00:01:34.208 --> 00:01:36.877
IN GAZA.

00:01:35.576 --> 00:01:37.545
SOME 40,000 PALESTINIANS

00:01:37.011 --> 00:01:38.646
STAGED DEMONSTRATIONS ALONG

00:01:37.678 --> 00:01:40.781
