OVER 50 PEOPLE WERE KILLED.

00:01:42.283 --> 00:01:45.986
MORE THAN 2300 WOUNDED.

00:01:44.552 --> 00:01:47.288
&gt;&gt; THIS HAS BEEN THE BIGGEST

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:48.222
PROTEST CARRIED OUT BY THE

00:01:47.421 --> 00:01:49.457
PALESTINIANS SINCE THE

00:01:48.355 --> 00:01:49.723
PROTESTS BEGAN SIX WEEKS

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:51.158
AGO.

00:01:49.857 --> 00:01:51.926
IT'S ALSO SEEN THE BIGGEST

00:01:51.292 --> 00:01:53.194
RESPONSE FROM THE ISRAELIS,

00:01:52.059 --> 00:01:55.429
MAKING THIS THE DEADLIEST

00:01:53.327 --> 00:01:56.931
DAY SINCE THE WAR IN 2014.

00:01:55.563 --> 00:01:58.399
&gt;&gt; ISRAELI MILITARY

00:01:57.064 --> 00:01:59.834
