00:02:08.709 --> 00:02:11.278
PALESTINIANS IN ADVANCE.

00:02:09.577 --> 00:02:13.414
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE TO BE VERY CLEAR

00:02:11.412 --> 00:02:15.082
AND SHARP AND IF NEEDED

00:02:13.547 --> 00:02:16.784
FORCEFUL TO DEFEND OUR

00:02:15.216 --> 00:02:17.852
BORDER BECAUSE ISRAELI

00:02:16.917 --> 00:02:18.152
CIVILIANS' LIVES ARE AT

00:02:17.985 --> 00:02:20.020
STAKE.

00:02:18.285 --> 00:02:21.188
&gt;&gt; PALESTINIAN LEADERS SAY

00:02:20.154 --> 00:02:22.022
THE MOVE HAS ENDED THEIR

00:02:21.322 --> 00:02:23.390
