00:02:22.156 --> 00:02:24.725
FORCING THEM TO WALK AWAY

00:02:23.524 --> 00:02:27.428
FROM PEACE TALKS.

00:02:24.859 --> 00:02:29.163
&gt;&gt; WE CONSIDER THAT

00:02:27.561 --> 00:02:31.665
AMERICA'S MOVING OF THE

00:02:29.296 --> 00:02:32.900
EMBASSY MEANS THE END OF

00:02:31.799 --> 00:02:33.701
AMERICAN CONTROL OF THE

00:02:33.033 --> 00:02:35.970
PEACE TALKS.

00:02:33.834 --> 00:02:37.471
WE WILL NOT GO BACK AGAIN TO

00:02:36.103 --> 00:02:39.340
AN AMERICAN LED PEACE TALKS.

00:02:37.605 --> 00:02:41.942
&gt;&gt; MORE PROTESTS ARE PLANNED

00:02:39.473 --> 00:02:42.676
