00:02:44.945 --> 00:02:49.083
BUT, IN ISRAEL TODAY, LITTLE

00:02:46.947 --> 00:02:50.417
COULD DAMPEN THE JOY AT

00:02:49.216 --> 00:02:50.985
AMERICA'S CLEAR SIGN OF

00:02:50.551 --> 00:02:53.087
COMMITMENT TO THEM.

00:02:51.118 --> 00:02:54.188
A SENTIMENT SHARED ACROSS

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:55.890
POLITICAL DIVIDES.

00:02:54.321 --> 00:02:56.857
AND EVEN SENATE MINORITY

00:02:56.023 --> 00:02:58.726
LEADER CHUCK SCHUMER PRAISED

00:02:56.991 --> 00:02:59.059
