00:03:00.261 --> 00:03:03.397
PRESIDENT TRUMP FOR DOING

00:03:00.928 --> 00:03:04.999
SO.

00:03:03.531 --> 00:03:06.133
AND IN TWO COUNTRIES,

00:03:05.132 --> 00:03:07.501
GUATEMALA AND PAIR GUY HAVE

00:03:06.267 --> 00:03:08.969
SAID THEY WILL FOLLOW SUIT

00:03:07.635 --> 00:03:09.336
AND MOVE THEIR EMBASSY TO

00:03:09.103 --> 00:03:10.671
JERUSALEM.

