NEWS JUST BREAKING IN THE

00:03:10.804 --> 00:03:13.274
LAST FEW HOURS, TURKEY HAS

00:03:12.239 --> 00:03:15.376
JUST ANNOUNCED IT IS GOING

00:03:13.407 --> 00:03:16.343
TO PUT OUT ITS AMBASSADOR TO

00:03:15.509 --> 00:03:18.212
THE U.S.

00:03:16.477 --> 00:03:18.546
BOTH IN RESPONSE TO THE

00:03:18.345 --> 00:03:20.014
EMBASSY.

